% Scenario: xshow positions each glyph. The user-space distances 10, 20,
% and 30 at size 10 are displacements of 1000, 2000, and 3000 glyph
% units in the text operation; the PDF expresses each as a TJ adjustment
% against the glyph's own width.
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
100 100 moveto (abc) [10 20 30] xshow
showpage
